.TH SDL_GetPerformanceCounter 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GetPerformanceCounter \- Get the current value of the high resolution counter.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_timer.h>
.PP
.BI "Uint64 SDL_GetPerformanceCounter(void);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
This function is typically used for profiling\[char46]
.PP
The counter values are only meaningful relative to each other\[char46] Differences between values can be converted to times by using
.BR SDL_GetPerformanceFrequency ()\[char46]

.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the current counter value\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
It is safe to call this function from any thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR SDL_GetPerformanceFrequency (3)
